          "summary": "The manuscript suffers from critical reporting errors (mislabeled CIs, omitted coefficient), implausible diagnostic values (BIC = -1032.9), undefined study question, and reliance on an exploratory analysis posture presented as final. These issues block any interpretation or dissemination. A full protocol and re-analysis are necessary.",
