                "stats-run/stats-run.json (estimates)"
              ],
              "whyItMatters": "Readers will misinterpret confidence intervals, potentially inferring no significant effect when odds-ratio CI does not cross 1.",
              "actionableFix": "Report odds-ratio 95% CIs from stats-run.json (or_ci_low, or_ci_high).",
